### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### USER SESSIONS API
### ============================================================

### Get sessions by user ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/by-user/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get user sessions by user ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user-sessions/by-user/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get active sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user-sessions/active
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get active session count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user-sessions/active-count
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a user session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user-sessions/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "ipAddress": "127.0.0.1",
    "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0"
}

### Deactivate a session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user-sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/deactivate
Cookie: {{token}}

### Terminate all sessions for a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user-sessions/terminate-all/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}
